    {
      "$comment": "Delivery ledger: one row per message sent to a lead, by a campaign or by hand, with the template and the exact version used and the provider's message id. `estado` is the same union as `actividades.estado_envio`; the timestamps are filled by the provider webhooks. `delete` is `nobody` on purpose: delivery evidence is not erasable from the browser, only by a superuser. No cascadeDelete: a delivery survives the deletion of its lead.",
      "name": "envios",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "lead",
          "type": "relation",
          "collection": "leads",
          "maxSelect": 1
